{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53085","headline":"同姜泛水题裴司马东斋 · 刘长卿","name":"同姜泛水题裴司马东斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不记鄱阳郡，俱因谪官过。\n白云心已矣，沧海意如何？\n蔾杖全吾道，榴花养太和。\n春风骑马醉，江月钓渔歌。\n步履侵苔廨，顷冠拂薜萝。\n远山终日在，芳草傍人多。\n莫学灵均怅，愁竟楚水波。\n（《新撰类林钞》卷四，据小川环树录文。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷一四九收此诗，题作《同姜濬题裴式微余干东斋》。\n内容大异，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}